4
00:00:16,550 --> 00:00:18,510
Sure, neighbor. Come on in.

5
00:00:19,890 --> 00:00:20,970
Is Janine around?

6
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:22,640
She's at dance class.

7
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:24,140
Can I check my room?

8
00:00:24,350 --> 00:00:27,230
Don't go through her stuff. She gets really mad.

9
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,610
Oh, my God.

10
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:35,610
It's like a guy never lived in here.

11
