- No.     - No.

17
00:00:52,380 --> 00:00:55,630
Okay, this is not good. You are a guy, okay?

18
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,510
This is a "guy's" place.

19
00:00:57,720 --> 00:01:00,850
Soon, you'll be soaking your fingers in stuff.

20
00:01:02,180 --> 00:01:05,600
- You're right. I'll talk to her.     - Talk to her. Be a man.

21
00:01:05,810 --> 00:01:07,640
- I'm a man.     - Defend yourself.

22
00:01:09,190 --> 00:01:11,320
We have to hem the new dust ruffle.

23
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:13,070
Be right there, sweetums.

24
00:01:15,650 --> 00:01:17,150
Totally different situation.

25
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,000

26
00:01:57,570 --> 00:01:59,060

27
