116
00:07:26,650 --> 00:07:27,820
Really?

117
00:07:28,820 --> 00:07:30,650
Yeah, what do you think?

118
00:07:30,860 --> 00:07:33,450
I think I shouldn't look directly at them.

119
00:07:33,950 --> 00:07:35,950
Come on, seriously.

120
00:07:37,990 --> 00:07:42,210
- They're really, really, really white.     - What was wrong with your old...

121
