123
00:07:49,170 --> 00:07:51,880
- How much longer?     - A day.

124
00:07:53,340 --> 00:07:55,510
Ross, tonight is your date with Hillary.

125
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:59,720
I know. That's why I did it. Are they really that bad?

126
00:08:00,770 --> 00:08:01,770
No. No, no, no.

127
00:08:01,980 --> 00:08:05,100
You'll be fine. Hillary's blind, right?

128
00:08:05,980 --> 00:08:07,860
She will be after tonight.

129
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:12,400
Oh, Rach. Uh, do you notice anything...?

130
00:08:12,610 --> 00:08:15,110
Your teeth? Yes, I saw them from outside.

131
00:08:16,620 --> 00:08:19,700
You guys are never gonna believe this...

132
00:08:19,910 --> 00:08:24,120
